ll give him that. It's hard to argue they're not a good company now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_6","text":"The polls reflect that too. Tetra's public image is overwhelmingly positive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_7","text":"Wait, did everyone just forget they used to be absolutely terrible?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_8","text":"People forget things quickly, and what Tetra's doing now makes that easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_9","text":"But they've gotten a lot weaker than the other Big Three, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_10","text":"Yes, they went through a fairly rough internal cleanup, so they've been in the red for a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_11","text":"That said, forecasts suggest that they should turn a profit in about two years.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_12","text":"Seems like focusing solely on entertainment is finally starting to pay off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_13","text":"That's pretty impressive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_14","text":"Oh right, they got rid of the indie charts a while back, didn't they?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_15","text":"Yes, it's been a while now. It was a pretty harsh system.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_16","text":"Wow, Tetra Line's really something, huh? At this point, it practically feels like a whole new company.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_17","text":"Kind of like CEO Mustang's new look, Tetra Line seems to be reinventing itself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_18","text":"Definitely one to watch going forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_19","text":"Anyway, moving on to our next story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mustang","mint","prika"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_20","text":"Hmm... so you've made your choice, oui?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_21","text":"Are you sure, mes chéris?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_22","text":"Yes, I've had a long talk with Prika.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_23","text":"We'll wait for Anis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_24","text":"When she comes back someday, we can start again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_25","text":"It does hurt a little since it feels as though she's leaving us behind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_26","text":"But she worked harder than anyone, and I know how deeply she must've been hurt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_27","text":"So I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_28","text":"That's why I'd like to ask you something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_29","text":"Allez, do tell.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis2_06_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis2_06_s_30","text":"Please let us stay in the industry.","jump":null,"exit":fa